o can you trust? Are your employers really the allies here? \n\nThis experience was made by Roman Entertainment\n\nBased on the SCP Universe\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━","path":"/game/5400959086-task-force","slug":"5400959086-task-force","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b80c20defafc2c67ba66e41c674b771d0572fc5ccee585c33d17ff40b21479f9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b4ff1c0092bd45d163bd87b24e42c73d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":45047368,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-01-15T01:11:39.092Z","creator":{"name":"Roman Entertainment","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":9845465117,"name":"[UPDATE 1] AU:Reborn","desc":"📢 New Code At 140k Likes 👍\nKeyboard Keybinds:\n-1,2,3,4 (Skills)\n- F (Block)\n- G (Awakening)\n- Q (Dash)\n\n🎮Controller Controls :\n- M1 (X)\n- M1 (Uptilt) (Y)\n- Dash (L3)\n- Jump (A)\n- Block (B)\n- Awakening (D-Pad Down)\n- Passive (D-Pad Up)\n- Shift Lock (D-Pad Right)\n- Sprint (Auto)\n- Skills (Bumpers/Triggers)","path":"/game/9845465117-au-reborn","slug":"9845465117-au-reborn","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5e413c56251ce70add010ee051dd79aac4c846cf852e7a86324a2e77d185acf2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e81e2bcb1bd6e7831b4c98072578b566/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":57061636,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-03-25T03:19:35.803Z","creator":{"name":"AU:R","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":24040136,"name":"Innovation Labs","desc":"Enjoy the labs? Check out the Roblox Innovation Labs toy pack now available!  Welcome to Innovation Labs, explore our giant underground facility and gaze upon the cutting edge of science research on ROBLOX, from physics to genetics, from lasers to waffles, there is always interesting and dangerous research to be done. Remember to Thumbs Up! Join Innovation: https://www.roblox.com/groups/group.aspx?gid=157764 \r\nUpdate (13/06/2019) - Converted to shadowmap, small fixes, changed meltdown music to comply with IP rule changes.","path":"/game/24040136-innovation-labs","slug":"24040136-innovation-labs","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6071d9d35686bcf343b5bf68d9d6d30f89e3477c492bebdf91481e58d282432f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e3387a24f1c3db50621fecb150420cd7/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":34530314,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T14:45:52.848Z","creator":{"name":"madattak","type":"User"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6700823483,"name":"(UPDATE!) Idiotic Investing","desc":"Welcome to Idiotic Investing, a multiplayer party type experience inspired by a Jackbox Party Pack 2 game!\r\n\r\n✍️In Idiotic Investing with 4 or more players, you are given two pieces of paper to draw two separate topics on! Once every player has submitted their masterpiece, the bidding begins!✍️\r\n\r\n💸At the start of every round, each player is given 3,000 credits to bid on other's art pieces. Once a player has successfully bid on a piece of art work, the true value of the piece will be revealed!💸\r\n\r\n💰Short on Credits? You can gain more by auctioning off some of your art pieces or taking a loan from the Blox Bank! Be careful though, at the end of the game you have to pay a 50% interest fee on your loans.💰\r\n\r\n🔩Want to annoy some of your friends? Half way through the round every player gains the abilty to screw a player and force them to bid once.🔩\r\n\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Invite some friends and let loose in the bidding!","path":"/game/6700823483-idiotic-investing","slug":"6700823483-idiotic-investing","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6150c49949b3d4afe37ca68809ffc2e3449959862fb8cab0e4d4c43776d3a5d9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c58772f6bf36fc350713b24285eb79b3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":18925163,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-08-19T12:58:58.076Z","creator":{"name":"Mewious","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":534701013,"name":"The Labyrinth","desc":"There are mazes of all shapes and sizes.\r\nMazes can be built with corn, mirrors, or fences.\r\nThey'll lead you to a dead end with winding paths and twists. \r\n\r\nOf course, if you're lucky, it's possible to find an exit.\r\n\r\nBut one thing all mazes have in common is a sense of excitement, indecision, and a desperate desire to escape.\r\n\r\nWill you be able to overcome the next maze? Are you brave enough to face the traps, monsters, and players in the dark realm along the way?\r\n\r\nYou can play solo or form a team with other players and use the resources you find to craft tools and weapons that will aid you on your journey through the labyrinth.\r\n\r\nThis game is based on The Maze Runner with a MMORPG touch to it.","path":"/game/534701013-the-labyrinth","slug":"534701013-the-labyrinth","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6709b1322b89d89749c5a7d139fef819289c8e0b4d82ef5feccf7121fa4ea837.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e62933fad6fb7a7a41c03a83cdd6636a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":55356676,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-08-26T07:09:16.077Z","creator":{"name":"Nitenity Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7256082823,"name":"[🎁] Dumb Boss Fights","desc":"Team up in order to defeat challenging bosses!\n• A unique arsenal of powerful weapons\n• Defeat powerful foes\n\nUpdate Log:\nhttps://devforum.roblox.com/t/rebranding-to-ebf6/1455171\n\n","path":"/game/7256082823-dumb-boss-fights","slug":"7256082823-dumb-boss-fights","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/027035d6b549c284ba10ad67404a962f9b53ca108d3bca0182205c05ae857094.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3b51b4a22b5a67b25851db0b3fcfd464/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":7917224,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-10-11T09:36:42.111Z","creator":{"name":"EBF6 Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6681484410,"name":"Lore Game","desc":"Mouse and keyboard is required even on console!\n\nMake sure to check the tutorial out before you play.\n\nThings like spoiling ingame content and having bad sportsmanship can get your mouth stitched shut","path":"/game/6681484410-lore-game","slug":"6681484410-lore-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8430d61e81c5ddd9bfa864541ca119e15145f5a2e91d814da49f66406fc0fbbb.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1e46407ecacc18e2c52064bebc0743ab/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":6079790,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2021-12-10T16:16:42.009Z","creator":{"name":"iaKuro3","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":3121370344,"name":"Pears to Pairs Card Game","desc":"Welcome to Pears to Pairs, a simple, fun, and hilarious tabletop card game! 🍐\n\nThe rules for the game are simple. Each player is given a random set of cards that are objects/phrases. At the start of each round, a judge is selected along with a random card, an adjective. Your goal? Select a card that you think the judge will pair with their card to win! 🏆\n\nWith 1500+ different game cards and various game modes, you are sure to come up with crazy card combinations and have endless hours of fun! At least 3 players in a server are needed to play. 🎮\n\nWith full device cross compatibility, you can play the game on the go on your phone or tablet. Your cards and win stats also save between all devices and servers. Private servers are free to rent to play specifically with your friends! 📱","path":"/game/3121370344-pears-to-pairs-card-game","slug":"3121370344-pears-to-pairs-card-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/670f05a162e25ce6b02e7314e00c756e974c20557ef0f7ef0e03922c3fafe4ae.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn